Brief BC energy clients on potential natural gas generation reporting adjustments under existing

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:30.140
climate frameworks. Monitor PEI drought response programs for implications on agricultural

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:35.960
environmental compliance. Mark your calendar for DFO announcements on Maryland,

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:42.540
Baluga transfer sequencing at the federal level which remains ongoing. Review Alberta municipal

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:49.300
